# Many stocks: how many investments the game handles (dev, TEST SAVE ONLY: needs the dev test
# stock option). Adds dev "Stress NNN" copies of a share stock to 33 investments (one past the
# game's MAX_INVESTMENT_COUNT constant of 32) and checks they show in Economy → Investments and the
# Stock Monitor; then fills to 254 (the game's limit: 255 slots, slot 0 unused) and tries to list
# a 255th and 256th, which should get no slot. Never overwrites a held investment (guarded). Logs
# frame time, the daily investment update and the Investments panel open time; removes every
# stress listing at the end.
name many stocks: 33 listed and visible, 254 listed, 255th and 256th get no slot
stress-stocks slots
stress-stocks clear
pause off
stress-measure 10
stress-stocks fill 33
expect-log slots used 33/254
stress-measure 10
stress-panel
count-investment-rows
expect-log investments panel: 33 visible row(s) for 33 investments
scroll-investments bottom
wait 1
capture many-stocks-33-investments
close-economy
monitor remember
monitor close
click FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorButton
wait 1
click FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorFilter-All
scroll-bottom FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorRows
wait 1
capture many-stocks-33-monitor
click FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorClose
stress-stocks fill 254
expect-log slots used 254/254
stress-measure 10
stress-panel
count-investment-rows
expect-log investments panel: 254 visible row(s) for 254 investments
scroll-investments bottom
wait 1
capture many-stocks-254-investments
close-economy
stress-stocks add 1
expect-log stress: added 1 (listed 0, no slot 1
stress-stocks add 1
stress-stocks slots
cleanup:
close-economy
monitor restore
stress-stocks clear
